# NEXO — public environment variables (not secrets)

# Public Formspree Form ID used by the Contact page form.
# Create a form at https://formspree.io, copy its ID (e.g. "xaybzqwa") and set
# it here. The ID is public — it ships in the page bundle — so configure it as
# a GitHub repository *variable* (not a secret) for the Pages build.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=

# Static-export base path. Empty locally; set to /NEXO only for the GitHub
# Pages build (injected by the deploy workflow).
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=